  "title": "FMC Corporation Announces Proposed Offering of $750.0 Million of Senior Secured Notes",
  "summary": "FMC Corporation (NYSE:FMC) (“FMC” or the “Company”), a leading global agricultural sciences company, today announced that it intends to offer, subject to market conditions and other factors, $750.0 million aggregate principal amount of senior secured notes due 2031 (the “Notes”), in a private offering to persons reasonably believed to be qualified institutional buyers in reliance on Rule 144A under the Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the “Securities Act”), and to non-U.S.",
